  "prefLabel": "He-C 6438.15 Title XX Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6438.15 Title XX Eligibility. As long as funding is available, the child shall be eligible for title XX social services without regard to income, both during the adoption process and after the adoption is final.\n\nSource. #8837, eff 3-8-07, EXPIRED: 3-8-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c6400.html"
